  "description": "C# PDF-417 Barcode Generation Guide: This package includes C# sample source code to create PDF 417 using XImage.Barcode Generator library\n\nOutput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg, tiff\n* Vector images: svg, eps\n* Document formats: PDF, Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx), PowerPoint (.pptx)\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Framework 4.x, 3.x, 2.x\n\nOnline Guides :\n* C# Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/barcode-generating-pdf417/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
